                        <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.maximum="5pt">THE COPYRIGHT HOLDERS AND THE ECLIPSE FOUNDATION WILL NOT BE
      LIABLE FOR ANY DIRECT, INDIRECT, SPECIAL OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES
      ARISING OUT OF ANY USE OF THE DOCUMENT OR THE PERFORMANCE OR
