      <fo:flow flow-name="xsl-region-body" start-indent="1in" end-indent="0pt">
         <fo:block id="service.network">
            <fo:block font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
               <fo:block margin-left="0pt">
                  <fo:block font-size="24.8832pt" font-weight="bold">
                     <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                               xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                               keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                               space-before.optimum="0in"
                               space-before.minimum="0in"
                               space-before.maximum="0in"
                               hyphenate="false"
                               text-align="start"
                               start-indent="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                               font-size="28pt"
                               line-height="35pt"
                               font-weight="normal"
                               space-after="24pt">
                        <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                       provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                           <fo:list-item>
                              <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                 <fo:block>143</fo:block>
                              </fo:list-item-label>
                              <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                 <fo:block>Network Interface Information Service Specification</fo:block>
                              </fo:list-item-body>
                           </fo:list-item>
                        </fo:list-block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                               xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookcItalic"
                               font-size="18pt"
                               line-height="25pt">
                        <fo:basic-link internal-destination="org.osgi.service.networkadapter">
                           <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                      font-family="inherit"
                                      letter-spacing="inherit"
                                      hyphenate="inherit">Version 1.0</fo:inline>
                        </fo:basic-link>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block id="d194e87">
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                            margin-left="0pt"
                            font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                     <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                        <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                  xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-weight="normal"
                                  keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                  space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                  space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                  text-align="start"
                                  start-indent="0pt"
                                  hyphenate="false">
                           <fo:marker marker-class-name="section.head.marker">Introduction</fo:marker>
                           <fo:block font-size="18pt"
                                     line-height="25pt"
                                     space-before="12.5pt"
                                     space-after="12pt">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>143.1</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>Introduction</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The Network Interface Information Service is a service that provides
    a standard way for bundles to receive notification about changes in the
    network interface and IP address.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">When the IP address has changed, bundles utilizing the IP address
    information need to detect this change. When using the standard Java API,
    such as <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">java.net.NetworkInterface</fo:inline> and
    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">java.net.InetAddress</fo:inline>, calls to confirm the IP address at
    regular intervals are required. Since this is a process common to all
    bundles that need to detect any change in IP address information, this
    specification defines a notification feature for all available network
    interfaces, including the IP address. In addition, this specification
    defines an API that provides the function to obtain the network interface
    information and the information about the IP address bound to a network
    interface.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The name of a network interface can be Operating System specific. In
    order for bundles to refer to the network interface it is necessary to
    distinguish the network interface in a form that it is independent of the
    Operating System.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">This specification defines the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">NetworkAdapter</fo:inline> Service
    and <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">NetworkAddress</fo:inline> Service. These services provide
    information about the network interface and IP addresses.</fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d194e103">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>143.1.1</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Entities</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                              space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                              space-after.optimum="1em"
                              space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                              provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                              id="d194e105">
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d194e106">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">Network Interface</fo:inline> - Available and
          activated network interfaces provided in the execution environment.
          In this specification, the unit of the network interface is the
          logical interface, not the physical interface.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d194e110">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">NetworkAdapter</fo:inline> - The OSGi service that
          provides information related to the Network Interface. This service
          provides function similar to
          <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">java.net.NetworkInterface</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d194e116">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">NetworkAddress</fo:inline> - The OSGi service that
          provides information of IP addresses available on the execution
          environment in which a Network Interface Information Service bundle
          is running.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d194e120">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">Network Interface Information Service
          bundle</fo:inline> - The OSGi bundle that implements NetworkAdapter
          and NetworkAddress services. Network Interface Information Service
          bundle registers NetworkAdapter and NetworkAddress services with the
          Framework.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d194e124">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">Network Interface Type</fo:inline> - An identifier of
          the network interface. It is independent of the operating system.
          The two type of identifier string is specified in this
          specification. This specification allows that Network Interface type
          other than them can be defined by the platform provider in each
          environment. This identifier is used by user bundle to specify the
          network interface to be monitored.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d194e128">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">IPAddressVersion</fo:inline> - An identifier
          indicating the IP address version. For example, IPv4, IPv6. This
          identifier is defined in this specification. This identifier is used
          by a bundle to specify the network interface to be monitored.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d194e132">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">IPAddressScope</fo:inline> - An identifier indicating
          the scope of IP address. For example, GLOBAL, PRIVATE. This
          identifier is defined in this specification. This identifier is used
          by a bundle to specify the network interface to be monitored.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
               <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.5em"
                         space-before.optimum="1em"
                         space-before.maximum="2em"
                         space-after.minimum="0.5em"
                         space-after.optimum="1em"
                         space-after.maximum="2em"
                         keep-together.within-column="always"
                         id="service.network-figure-143-1">
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            font-weight="normal"
                            font-size="9pt"
                            hyphenate="false"
                            space-after.minimum="0.4em"
                            space-after.optimum="0.6em"
                            space-after.maximum="0.8em"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            font-family="Proforma-Book,ArialUnicodeMS"
                            font-style="italic"
                            keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block>Figure 143.1</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>Network Interface Information Service Overview Diagram</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block id="d194e138" text-align="center">
                     <fo:external-graphic src="url(file:///home/stbischof/git/OSGI_MIGRATE/osgi_target/org.osgi.service.networkadapter/spec/org.osgi.spec.service.networkadapter/src/main/resources/spec/service_network_classes.svg)"
                                          width="auto"
                                          height="auto"
                                          content-width="5.000in"
                                          content-height="3.750in"
                                          text-align="center"/>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.networkadapter.NetworkAdapter">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">NetworkAdapter</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> service provides the network interface
      information for a logical interface. <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.networkadapter.NetworkAddress">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">NetworkAddress</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> service provides the IP address information for
      an IP address. A <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">NetworkAddress</fo:inline> service is associated with
      a <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">NetworkAdapter</fo:inline> service.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">When network interface information is changed, the service
      properties of the corresponing <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">NetworkAdapter</fo:inline> service and
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">NetworkAddress</fo:inline> service are changed. It is necessary for the
      bundle using these services to track these services and be advised of
      changes in the network interface information through Service
      Events.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block id="d194e157">
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                            margin-left="0pt"
                            font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                     <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                        <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                  xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-weight="normal"
                                  keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                  space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                  space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                  text-align="start"
                                  start-indent="0pt"
                                  hyphenate="false">
                           <fo:marker marker-class-name="section.head.marker">NetworkAdapter Service</fo:marker>
                           <fo:block font-size="18pt"
                                     line-height="25pt"
                                     space-before="12.5pt"
                                     space-after="12pt">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>143.2</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>NetworkAdapter Service</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">
               <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="org.osgi.service.networkadapter.NetworkAdapter">
                  <fo:inline color="blue"
                             font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em"
                             hyphenate="false">NetworkAdapter</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link> is an interface that provides information about a
    single network interface provided by the execution environment. If
    multiple network interfaces are present, <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">NetworkAdapter</fo:inline>
    services that correspond to each network interface must be registered.
    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">NetworkAdapter</fo:inline> services must be registered with service
    properties as shown in the following table.</fo:block>
            <fo:block xmlns:rx="http://www.renderx.com/XSL/Extensions"
                      space-before.minimum="0.5em"
                      space-before.optimum="1em"
                      space-before.maximum="2em"
                      space-after.minimum="0.5em"
                      space-after.optimum="1em"
                      space-after.maximum="2em"
                      keep-together.within-column="auto"
                      id="d194e166">
               <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                         xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                         space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt"
                         font-weight="normal"
                         font-size="9pt"
                         hyphenate="false"
                         space-after.minimum="0.4em"
                         space-after.optimum="0.6em"
                         space-after.maximum="0.8em"
                         start-indent="0pt"
                         font-family="Proforma-Book,ArialUnicodeMS"
                         font-style="italic"
                         keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                  <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                     <fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                           <fo:block>Table 143.1</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>Service properties of NetworkAdapter service</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:table border-before-width.conditionality="retain"
                         border-collapse="collapse"
                         table-layout="fixed"
                         width="100%">
                  <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="proportional-column-width(3)"/>
                  <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/>
                  <fo:table-column column-number="3" column-width="proportional-column-width(3)"/>
                  <fo:table-header start-indent="0pt" end-indent="0pt">
                     <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always"
                                   keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                   font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>The key of service property</fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>Type</fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>Description</fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                     </fo:table-row>
                  </fo:table-header>
                  <fo:table-body start-indent="0pt" end-indent="0pt">
                     <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">networkAdapter.type</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">String</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>Required property. Network interface type is set to a
            value.</fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                     </fo:table-row>
                     <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">networkAdapter.hardwareAddress</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">byte[]</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>Required property. Hardware address (MAC address) is set to
            a value. This property can also be obtained from <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.networkadapter.NetworkAdapter.getHardwareAddress--">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">getHardwareAddress()</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                     </fo:table-row>
                     <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">networkAdapter.name</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">String</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>Required property. Network interface name is set to a
            value. This property can also be obtained from <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.networkadapter.NetworkAdapter.getName--">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">getName()</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                     </fo:table-row>
                     <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">networkAdapter.displayName</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">String</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>Required property. Network interface display name is set to
            a value. This property can also be obtained from <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.networkadapter.NetworkAdapter.getDisplayName--">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">getDisplayName()</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                     </fo:table-row>
                     <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">networkAdapter.isUp</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">boolean</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>Required property. The value is true when a network
            interface is up and running, otherwise it is false.</fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                     </fo:table-row>
                     <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">networkAdapter.isLoopback</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">boolean</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>Required property. The value is true when a network
            interface is a loopback interface, otherwise it is false.</fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                     </fo:table-row>
                     <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">networkAdapter.isPointToPoint</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">boolean</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>Required property. The value is true when a network
            interface is a point to point interface, otherwise it is
            false.</fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                     </fo:table-row>
                     <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">networkAdapter.isVirtual</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">boolean</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>Required property. The value is true when a network
            interface is a virtual interface, otherwise it is false.</fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                     </fo:table-row>
                     <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">networkAdapter.supportsMulticast</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">boolean</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>Required property. The value is true when a network
            interface supports multicasting, otherwise it is false.</fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                     </fo:table-row>
                     <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">networkAdapter.parent</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">String</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>Required property. Service PID of the NetworkAdapter
            service which is parent of this NetworkAdapter is
            specified.</fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                     </fo:table-row>
                     <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">networkAdapter.subInterface</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">String[]</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>Required property. Service PID of the NetworkAdapter
            service which is subinterface of this NetworkAdapter is
            specified.</fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                     </fo:table-row>
                  </fo:table-body>
               </fo:table>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">When a network interface becomes available, a
    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">NetworkAdapter</fo:inline> service associated with the network interface
    is registered with the service registry. If the network interface becomes
    unavailable, the corresponding <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">NetworkAdapter</fo:inline> service is
    unregistered.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">When the attribute values of the network interface change, the
    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">NetworkAdapter</fo:inline> service is updated with changed service
    properties. <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">NetworkAdapter</fo:inline> interface provides a method
    corresponding to <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">java.net.NetworkInterface</fo:inline> in order to
    provide information on the associated network interface.</fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d194e267">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>143.2.1</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Network Interface Type</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Identifying the network interface is possible by using the network
      interface name. However, since the network interface name is an
      identifier that is dependent on the operating system, if network
      interface name is used as identifier, bundles must be implemented to be
      aware of the operating system. Therefore, in this specification,
      "network interface type” which is independent of the operating system,
      is used to identify the network interface. The network interface type
      string of "LAN" and "WAN" are defined in this specification. This
      specification allows that Network Interface type other than "LAN"and
      "WAN" can be defined by the platform provider in each environment. It is
      provided by the platform provider on which Network Interface Information
      Service bundle is running. Network Interface type "LAN"indicates the
      network interface connects to a local area network. Network Interface
      type "WAN" indicates the network interface connects to an external
      network (i.e. Internet). If a bundle wants to obtain the information of
      the network interface connected to the Internet, the bundle is able to
      get it by obtaining <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">NetworkAdapter</fo:inline> service with the
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">networkAdapter.type</fo:inline> service property set to the value
      "WAN".</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">This specification allows that Network Interface type other than
      "LAN"and "WAN" can be defined by the platform provider in each
      environment. It may be provided by the platform provider on which
      Network Interface Information Service bundle is running.</fo:block>
               <fo:block xmlns:rx="http://www.renderx.com/XSL/Extensions"
                         space-before.minimum="0.5em"
                         space-before.optimum="1em"
                         space-before.maximum="2em"
                         space-after.minimum="0.5em"
                         space-after.optimum="1em"
                         space-after.maximum="2em"
                         keep-together.within-column="auto"
                         id="d194e276">
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            font-weight="normal"
                            font-size="9pt"
                            hyphenate="false"
                            space-after.minimum="0.4em"
                            space-after.optimum="0.6em"
                            space-after.maximum="0.8em"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            font-family="Proforma-Book,ArialUnicodeMS"
                            font-style="italic"
                            keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block>Table 143.2</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>Network Interface Type</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:table border-before-width.conditionality="retain"
                            border-collapse="collapse"
                            table-layout="fixed"
                            width="100%">
                     <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="proportional-column-width(2)"/>
                     <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="proportional-column-width(3)"/>
                     <fo:table-header start-indent="0pt" end-indent="0pt">
                        <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always"
                                      keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                      font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>Network Interface Type</fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>Description</fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                        </fo:table-row>
                     </fo:table-header>
                     <fo:table-body start-indent="0pt" end-indent="0pt">
                        <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">LAN</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">The network interface to connect to a local area
              network. </fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                        </fo:table-row>
                        <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">WAN</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">The network interface to connect to an external
              network (i.e. Internet). </fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                        </fo:table-row>
                     </fo:table-body>
                  </fo:table>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block id="d194e296">
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                            margin-left="0pt"
                            font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                     <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                        <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                  xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-weight="normal"
                                  keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                  space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                  space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                  text-align="start"
                                  start-indent="0pt"
                                  hyphenate="false">
                           <fo:marker marker-class-name="section.head.marker">NetworkAddress Service</fo:marker>
                           <fo:block font-size="18pt"
                                     line-height="25pt"
                                     space-before="12.5pt"
                                     space-after="12pt">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>143.3</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>NetworkAddress Service</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">
               <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="org.osgi.service.networkadapter.NetworkAddress">
                  <fo:inline color="blue"
                             font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em"
                             hyphenate="false">NetworkAddress</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link> interface provides information about an IP address
    available in the execution environment in which the a Network Interface
    Information Service bundle is running. <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">NetworkAddress</fo:inline> service
    is registered with the service registry together with service properties
    as shown in the following table.</fo:block>
            <fo:block xmlns:rx="http://www.renderx.com/XSL/Extensions"
                      space-before.minimum="0.5em"
                      space-before.optimum="1em"
                      space-before.maximum="2em"
                      space-after.minimum="0.5em"
                      space-after.optimum="1em"
                      space-after.maximum="2em"
                      keep-together.within-column="auto"
                      id="d194e303">
               <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                         xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                         space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt"
                         font-weight="normal"
                         font-size="9pt"
                         hyphenate="false"
                         space-after.minimum="0.4em"
                         space-after.optimum="0.6em"
                         space-after.maximum="0.8em"
                         start-indent="0pt"
                         font-family="Proforma-Book,ArialUnicodeMS"
                         font-style="italic"
                         keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                  <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                     <fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                           <fo:block>Table 143.3</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>Service properties of NetworkAddress service</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:table border-before-width.conditionality="retain"
                         border-collapse="collapse"
                         table-layout="fixed"
                         width="100%">
                  <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="proportional-column-width(3)"/>
                  <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/>
                  <fo:table-column column-number="3" column-width="proportional-column-width(3)"/>
                  <fo:table-header start-indent="0pt" end-indent="0pt">
                     <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always"
                                   keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                   font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>The key of service property</fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>Type</fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>Description</fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                     </fo:table-row>
                  </fo:table-header>
                  <fo:table-body start-indent="0pt" end-indent="0pt">
                     <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">networkAdapter.type</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">String</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>Required property. Network interface type is set to a
            value.</fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                     </fo:table-row>
                     <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">ipAddress.version</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">String</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>Required property. IP address version is set to a
            value.</fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                     </fo:table-row>
                     <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">ipAddress.scope</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">String</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>Required property. IP address scope is set to a
            value.</fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                     </fo:table-row>
                     <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">ipAddress</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">String</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>Required property. IP address String is set to a
            value.</fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                     </fo:table-row>
                     <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">subnetmask.length</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">int</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>Required property. Subnet mask length of the required
            properties IPv4, or IPv6 prefix length is set to a value.</fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                     </fo:table-row>
                     <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">networkAdapter.pid</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">String</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>Required property. Service PID of the NetworkAdapterService
            corresponding to the network interface binding this IP address is
            set to a value.</fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                     </fo:table-row>
                  </fo:table-body>
               </fo:table>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">A <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">NetworkAddress</fo:inline> service is registered with the service
    registry for each available IP address. When an associated IP address is
    deleted, or the network interface to which the IP address is bound becomes
    unavailable, the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">NetworkAddress</fo:inline> service is unregistered. When
    the associated IP address changes, the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">NetworkAddress</fo:inline> service
    is updated with updated service properties. A bundle can detect the change
    of IP address by monitoring the registration or unregistering, updating of
    the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">NetworkAddress</fo:inline> service. When registering a NetworkAdapter
    service, the Network Interface Information Service bundle must register it
    with a unique service PID. Because IP addresses are bound to a network
    interface, the service PID of the associated <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">NetworkAdapter</fo:inline>
    service and its network interface type are set in the service properties
    of the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">NetworkAddress</fo:inline> service.</fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d194e366">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>143.3.1</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>IP Address Version</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Defines the version of the IP address. A bundle can select
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">NetworkAddress</fo:inline> services using the following IP address
      version.</fo:block>
               <fo:block xmlns:rx="http://www.renderx.com/XSL/Extensions"
                         space-before.minimum="0.5em"
                         space-before.optimum="1em"
                         space-before.maximum="2em"
                         space-after.minimum="0.5em"
                         space-after.optimum="1em"
                         space-after.maximum="2em"
                         keep-together.within-column="auto"
                         id="d194e372">
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            font-weight="normal"
                            font-size="9pt"
                            hyphenate="false"
                            space-after.minimum="0.4em"
                            space-after.optimum="0.6em"
                            space-after.maximum="0.8em"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            font-family="Proforma-Book,ArialUnicodeMS"
                            font-style="italic"
                            keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block>Table 143.4</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>IP Address Version</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:table border-before-width.conditionality="retain"
                            border-collapse="collapse"
                            table-layout="fixed"
                            width="100%">
                     <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="proportional-column-width(2)"/>
                     <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="proportional-column-width(3)"/>
                     <fo:table-header start-indent="0pt" end-indent="0pt">
                        <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always"
                                      keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                      font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>IP Address Version</fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>Description</fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                        </fo:table-row>
                     </fo:table-header>
                     <fo:table-body start-indent="0pt" end-indent="0pt">
                        <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">IPV4</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">IP address version which means IPv4 address.
              </fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                        </fo:table-row>
                        <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">IPV6</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">IP address version which means IPv6 address.
              </fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                        </fo:table-row>
                     </fo:table-body>
                  </fo:table>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d194e392">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>143.3.2</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>IP address scope</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">Defins the scope of the IP address. A bundle can select
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">NetworkAddress</fo:inline> services using the following IP address
      scope.</fo:block>
               <fo:block xmlns:rx="http://www.renderx.com/XSL/Extensions"
                         space-before.minimum="0.5em"
                         space-before.optimum="1em"
                         space-before.maximum="2em"
                         space-after.minimum="0.5em"
                         space-after.optimum="1em"
                         space-after.maximum="2em"
                         keep-together.within-column="auto"
                         id="d194e398">
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            font-weight="normal"
                            font-size="9pt"
                            hyphenate="false"
                            space-after.minimum="0.4em"
                            space-after.optimum="0.6em"
                            space-after.maximum="0.8em"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            font-family="Proforma-Book,ArialUnicodeMS"
                            font-style="italic"
                            keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block>Table 143.5</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>IP Address Scope</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:table border-before-width.conditionality="retain"
                            border-collapse="collapse"
                            table-layout="fixed"
                            width="100%">
                     <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="proportional-column-width(2)"/>
                     <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="proportional-column-width(3)"/>
                     <fo:table-header start-indent="0pt" end-indent="0pt">
                        <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always"
                                      keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                      font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>IP Address Scope</fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>Description</fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                        </fo:table-row>
                     </fo:table-header>
                     <fo:table-body start-indent="0pt" end-indent="0pt">
                        <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">GLOBAL</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">IP address scope which means global
              address.</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                        </fo:table-row>
                        <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">PRIVATE_USE</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">IP address scope which means private
              address.</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                        </fo:table-row>
                        <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">LOOPBACK</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">IP address scope which means loopback
              address.</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                        </fo:table-row>
                        <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">LINKLOCAL</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">IP address scope which means link local
              address.</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                        </fo:table-row>
                        <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">UNIQUE_LOCAL</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">IP address scope which means
              unique-localaddress.</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                        </fo:table-row>
                        <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">UNSPECIFIED</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                           <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                          padding-end="4pt"
                                          padding-top="1pt"
                                          padding-bottom="1pt">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">IP address scope which means the absence of an
              address. </fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:table-cell>
                        </fo:table-row>
                     </fo:table-body>
                  </fo:table>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">If a bundle which wants to check for an IP address of the IPv4
      global, the bundle is able to confirm by obtaining
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">NetworkAddress</fo:inline> service with the
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">ipAddress.version</fo:inline> service property set to the value
      "<fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">IPV4</fo:inline>" and the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">ipAddress.scope</fo:inline> service
      property set to the value "<fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">GLOBAL</fo:inline>".</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block id="d194e450">
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                            margin-left="0pt"
                            font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                     <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                        <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                  xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-weight="normal"
                                  keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                  space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                  space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                  text-align="start"
                                  start-indent="0pt"
                                  hyphenate="false">
                           <fo:marker marker-class-name="section.head.marker">A Controller Example</fo:marker>
                           <fo:block font-size="18pt"
                                     line-height="25pt"
                                     space-before="12.5pt"
                                     space-after="12pt">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>143.4</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>A Controller Example</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The following example shows the usage of <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">NetworkAddress</fo:inline>
    service. The sample <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">Controller</fo:inline> class extends the
    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">ServiceTracker</fo:inline> class so that it can track
    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">NetworkAddress</fo:inline> services.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                      space-before.optimum="1em"
                      space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                      space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                      space-after.optimum="1em"
                      space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                      hyphenate="false"
                      wrap-option="no-wrap"
                      white-space-collapse="false"
                      white-space-treatment="preserve"
                      linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                      text-align="start"
                      font-family="ProductusOSGiMonoc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                      font-size="9pt"
                      letter-spacing="-.0em"
                      space-before="5pt"
                      space-after="3pt"
                      space-after.conditionality="retain"
                      start-indent="inherit"
                      line-height="11pt"
                      id="d194e462">class Controller extends ServiceTracker {
  Controller(BundleContext context) {
    super(context, NetworkAdapter.class.getName(), null);
  }

  public Object addingService(ServiceReference ref) {
    NetworkAdapter addAdapter =  (NetworkAdapter)super.addingService(ref);
    String type = addAdapter.getNetworkAdapterType();
    String displayName = addAdapter.getDisplayName();

    // ...

    String servicePID = (String)ref.getProperty(Constants.SERVICE_PID);
    try {
      String filter 
         = "(" + NetworkAddress.NETWORKADAPTER_PID + "=" + servicePID + ")";
      ServiceReference[] refs  
        = context.getServiceReferences(NetworkAddress.class.getName(), filter);
      for (int i = 0; i &lt; refs.length; i++) {
        NetworkAddress address = (NetworkAddress) context.getService(refs[i]);
        String ipAddress = address.getIpAddress();
        int subnetMaskLength = address.getSubnetMaskLength();
         // ...
       }
    } catch (InvalidSyntaxException e) {
      e.printStackTrace();
    }
    return addAdapter;
  }
}</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block id="d194e463">
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                            margin-left="0pt"
                            font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                     <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                        <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                  xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-weight="normal"
                                  keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                  space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                  space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                  text-align="start"
                                  start-indent="0pt"
                                  hyphenate="false">
                           <fo:marker marker-class-name="section.head.marker">Security</fo:marker>
                           <fo:block font-size="18pt"
                                     line-height="25pt"
                                     space-before="12.5pt"
                                     space-after="12pt">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>143.5</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>Security</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">To acquire network interface information, a bundle needs
    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">ServicePermission[NetworkAdapter, GET]</fo:inline> and
    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">ServicePermission[NetworkAddress, GET]</fo:inline>. It can use Filter
    Based Permissions. When a platform provider performs access control of the
    bundle, It can set ServicePermission like the following example.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">
               <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">ServicePermission["(&amp;(objectClass=org.osgi.service.networkadapter.NetworkAdapter)(networkAdapter.type=LAN))",GET]
    </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">
               <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">ServicePermission["(&amp;(objectClass=org.osgi.service.networkadapter.NetworkAddress)(networkAdapter.type=LAN)
    (ipAddress.version=IPV4)(ipAddress.scope=PRIVATE_USE))", GET]
    </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">NetworkAdapter</fo:inline> service and the
    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">NetworkAddress</fo:inline> service should only be implemented by trusted
    bundles. This bundle requires <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">ServicePermission[NetworkAdapter,
    REGISTER]</fo:inline> and <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">ServicePermission[NetworkAddress,
    REGISTER]</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.networkadapter">
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                            margin-left="0pt"
                            font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                     <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                        <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                  xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-weight="normal"
                                  keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                  space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                  space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                  text-align="start"
                                  start-indent="0pt"
                                  hyphenate="false">
                           <fo:marker marker-class-name="section.head.marker">org.osgi.service.networkadapter</fo:marker>
                           <fo:block font-size="18pt"
                                     line-height="25pt"
                                     space-before="12.5pt"
                                     space-after="12pt">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>143.6</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>org.osgi.service.networkadapter<fo:inline id="org.osgi.service.networkadapter-version"/>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"/>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">
Network Interface Information Service Specification Package Version 1.0.

 </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">
 Bundles wishing to use this package must list the package in the
 Import-Package header of the bundle's manifest. This package has two types of
 users: the consumers that use the API in this package and the providers that
 implement the API in this package.

 </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">
 Example import for consumers using the API in this package:
 </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">
 {@code  Import-Package: org.osgi.service.networkadapter; version="[1.0,2.0)"}
 </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">
 Example import for providers implementing the API in this package:
 </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">
 {@code  Import-Package: org.osgi.service.networkadapter; version="[1.0,1.1)"}</fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d194e498">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>143.6.1</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Summary</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                              space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                              space-after.optimum="1em"
                              space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                              provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                              id="d194e500">
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d194e501">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.networkadapter.NetworkAdapter">
                                 <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                            font-family="inherit"
                                            letter-spacing="inherit"
                                            hyphenate="inherit">
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">NetworkAdapter</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - 
NetworkAdapter is an interface that provides information about single network
 interfaces provided by the execution environment.
   </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d194e509">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.networkadapter.NetworkAddress">
                                 <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                            font-family="inherit"
                                            letter-spacing="inherit"
                                            hyphenate="inherit">
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">NetworkAddress</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - 
This interface represents an IP address information.
   </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.networkadapter.NetworkAdapter">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>143.6.2</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>public abstract NetworkAdapter</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
NetworkAdapter is an interface that provides information about single network
 interfaces provided by the execution environment.
 
 </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
 If multiple network interfaces are present, NetworkAdapter Services that
 correspond to each network interface must be registered. Network interface
 information service is set the following information as service property.
 </fo:block>
               <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                              space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                              space-after.optimum="1em"
                              space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                              provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                              id="d194e521">
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d194e522">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>{@link #NETWORKADAPTER_TYPE} : Network Interface Type</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d194e524">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>{@link #NETWORKADAPTER_DISPLAYNAME} : Network Interface Display Name</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d194e526">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>{@link #NETWORKADAPTER_NAME} : Network Interface Name</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d194e528">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>{@link #NETWORKADAPTER_HARDWAREADDRESS} : Hardware Address</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d194e530">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>{@link #NETWORKADAPTER_IS_UP} : Running status of Network Interface</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d194e532">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>{@link #NETWORKADAPTER_IS_LOOPBACK} : To check loopback interface</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d194e534">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>{@link #NETWORKADAPTER_IS_POINTTOPOINT} : To check point to point
 interface</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d194e536">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>{@link #NETWORKADAPTER_IS_VIRTUAL} : To check virtual interface</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d194e538">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>{@link #NETWORKADAPTER_SUPPORTS_MULTICAST} : To check supports
 multicasting</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d194e540">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>{@link #NETWORKADAPTER_PARENT} : The PID of parent Network Interface</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d194e542">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>{@link #NETWORKADAPTER_SUBINTERFACE} : The PID of sub Network Interface</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
 When a network interface becomes available, NetworkAdapter service associated
 with the network interface is registered with the service registry. If the
 network interface becomes unavailable, the corresponding NetworkAdapter
 service is unregistered.
 </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
 When the attribute values of the network interface are set to the service
 property changes, NetworkAdapter service is updated. NetworkAdapter interface
 provides a method corresponding to java.net.NetworkInterface in order to
 provide information on the associated network interface. However, this
 interface method does not support the Static method. In addition, because
 NetworkInterface object or InetAddress object is registered in the service
 registry as NetworkAdapter and NetworkAddress, the NetworkAdapter interface
 does not provide a method to get those objects. NetworkAdapter provides a
 method to retrieve the value of an attribute of a network interface.</fo:block>
               <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                         xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                         space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt"
                         start-indent="0pt"
                         relative-align="baseline">
                  <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                     <fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                           <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                              <fo:block>Concurrency</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>Thread-safe </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.networkadapter.NetworkAdapter.EMPTY_BYTE_ARRAY">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
